<!--
  The same three guids as feed-base.xml. Item 1 has a CHANGED TITLE and a
  CHANGED BODY; items 2 and 3 are byte-identical to feed-base.xml. A fourth,
  brand-new item is prepended, as a real feed would.

  What this proves: updated: 1, created: 1, unchanged: 2 — and that the edited
  post keeps the slug it was inserted with even though its title moved.
-->
